"Keycloak Dev Services.\n"
"The SPIFFE Dev Service bundle endpoint listens on port `18443` by default, "
"and Keycloak must be able to reach it:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Alternatively, if you already have an existing realm, export it to a JSON "
"file and set the SPIFFE identity provider's `trustDomain` to `spiffe://test."
"quarkus.io` and `bundleEndpoint` to `http://host.testcontainers.internal:"
"18443/bundle`.\n"
"In your realm JSON file, add or update the SPIFFE identity provider entry in "
"the `identityProviders` array:"
msgstr ""

